=== layout: bookend

# Key Takeaways

@body

- Selection changes allele frequencies through reproductive success.
- Fitness is measured relative to the comparison population.
- Different environments can favor different phenotypes.
- Heterozygote advantage can maintain both alleles.

=== layout: theend

